%description:
Tests that F-RTO (RFC 5682, frtoEnabled=true) does not take data that
the receiver SACKed before the timeout as new evidence. The tester deletes
the first of three segments, and the receiver SACKs the other two. The
timeout clears the SACK marks (RFC 2018 section 8). The ACK of the
retransmission acknowledges 1501, and the data above 501 was sent once.
But the receiver reported that data before the timeout, so the loss was
real (Linux FLAG_ORIG_SACK_ACKED skips TCPCB_SACKED_ACKED), and the sender
keeps the reduction.
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

network = inet.test.moduletest.lib.TcpTestNet1

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

*.testing=false

*.tcptester.script="a3 delete"

*.cli_app.active=true
*.cli_app.localAddress="10.0.0.1"
*.cli_app.localPort=1000
*.cli_app.connectAddress="10.0.0.2"
*.cli_app.connectPort=2000
*.cli_app.tOpen=0s
*.cli_app.tSend=-1s
*.cli_app.sendBytes=0B
*.cli_app.sendScript="1 1500;6 500"
*.cli_app.tClose=-1s

*.srv_app.active=false
*.srv_app.localAddress="10.0.0.2"
*.srv_app.localPort=2000
*.srv_app.connectAddress="10.0.0.1"
*.srv_app.connectPort=1000
*.srv_app.tOpen=0s
*.srv_app.tSend=-1s
*.srv_app.sendBytes=0B
*.srv_app.sendScript=""
*.srv_app.tClose=-1s

*.*_tcp.advertisedWindow = 5000
*.*_tcp.sackSupport = true
*.*_tcp.mss = 500
*.*_tcp.tcpAlgorithmClass = "TcpReno"
*.*_tcp.frtoEnabled = true
*.*_tcp.increasedIWEnabled = true



%contains: stdout
[4.003 B004] A.1000 < B.2000: A ack 1501 win 5000

%contains: stdout
F-RTO: the first new ACK after the timeout acknowledges no data that was sent once, the loss is real

%not-contains: stdout
F-RTO: spurious

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
